  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted  therewith  (Design and Access Statement, AA211321-S1/P-020B, PCF01375-001 30, 001 P5, PCF01375-030-01 01, Storage Building Specification received 12/8/11) and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - The use hereby permitted shall be discontinued on or before the 30/11/16 and the hereby approved buildings removed within three months of this date with the land restored in accordance with the landscaping/parking plan approved pursuant to masterplan application P/2006/2214 or in line with a scheme of work submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 4 - Prior to the first use of the hospitality services facility an updated BSkyB campus travel plan shall be submitted to and approved in writing by  the local planning authority  to include the operation and monitoring of this facility."
